<title>USA: Taiwan seeks 108,000 tonnes U.S. corn - exporters.</title>
<headline>Taiwan seeks 108,000 tonnes U.S. corn - exporters.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's CK Group has scheduled a tender for late Tuesday for 108,000 tonnes of No. 2 U.S. corn, U.S. exporters said.</p>
<p>It seeks two 54,000-tonne cargoes. The first is for May 11 to 25 if from the U.S. Gulf ports or May 26 to June 9 if from West Coast ports.</p>
<p>The second cargo is for May 25 to June 8 from the U.S. Gulf or June 9 to 23 from the West Coast.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
